":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}]\n10:Tc49,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace#webpage\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace\",\"name\":\"Client Space | PYNGYN, the standalone branded client portal for professional-services firms\",\"description\":\"Give every client a branded portal where they see status, documents, and approvals 24/7 instead of emailing you. $19 per client / month, standalone.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\"},\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Client Space\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace\"}]},{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is Client Space?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Client Space is a branded client portal for your firm, sold on its own. Each client gets their own secure, isolated space showing the status of their engagement, their documents, approvals, and invoices, so they stop emailing you for updates and start self-serving 24/7.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much does Client Space cost?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Client Space is $19 per client per month, standalone, you don't need to buy Workspace to use it. If your firm also wants Workspace (your internal back office, $9 per seat/month), you can bundle both for $24.99/month.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do my clients need to create an account or remember a password?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Clients join with a one-click magic link, no password to remember and no login friction. Login frustration is the number-one reason client portals go unused, so we removed it entirely.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can clients see my other clients, or my internal work?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Never. Each Client Space is fully isolated. A client sees only their own engagement, never another client's work, and never your internal operations. You control exactly what's visible.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is it secure enough for legal and financial documents?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Documents are encrypted in transit and at rest, access is controlled per client, and every action is logged in an audit trail, far safer than emailing sensitive records, which most firms still do.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I brand it as my own firm?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Client Space is white-labeled with your logo, colors, and domain. To your clients, it looks and feels like your firm's own portal.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is Workspace, and do I need it?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Workspace is a separate product, your firm's internal back office for projects, finances, and billable time. You don't need it to use Client Space. Firms that want both can bundle Workspace and Client Space together for $24.99/month.\"}}]}]}9:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],[\"$L14\",\"$L15\"],\"$L16\"]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"children\":\"$L18\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1a\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$L1b\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\"